    "name": "Shred Video",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/3d612516760a137f36f04de94b593835d2a101f5.png",
    "oneLiner": "Shred Video builds automated video & photo systems that allow…",
    "longDescription": "Shred Video, a new startup launching out of Y Combinator, allows users to take footage from their iPhone, GoPro or drone and simply match it with a song from the user’s iTunes library. That’s all. Shred Video does the rest of the work.\r\n\r\nTaking into account the acceleration of the camera itself, Shred Video can pin-point the moments of action for surfers, snowboarders, skaters and other acceleration-based sports to highlight all of the coolest clips in your footage. And beyond that, Shred Video matches those epic moments with the beat-drop of the song.",
