    "oneLiner": "Rare Disease-Focused Care Delivery and Evidence Generation Platform",
    "longDescription": "* Category leading RWE platform generating differentiated data through combination of a provider community and patient-reported outcomes; delivering personalized and comparative evidence at the point of care\r\n\r\n* Singular network architecture and data capturing capabilities help identify patients with unmet needs in real-time; unlocking opportunities to improve health outcomes and additional revenue for pharma\r\n\r\n* Microhealth has achieved product-market fit in the hemophilia and rare blood disorders space\r\n\r\nToday, we are the world's leader in digital hematology:\r\n\r\n- Our US hemophilia network covers 33%+ of patients on prophylaxis and 50%+ of hemophilia treatment centers\r\n \r\n- Average active-user retention is 52 months\r\n \r\n- Trusted by leading pharmaceutical sponsors: Novo Nordisk, Sanofi, Roche and Pfizer",
