    "oneLiner": "Become the leader your company needs.",
    "longDescription": "Leaders In Tech is a leadership accelerator designed for startups.  Over 350 alumni founders now run companies valued at over $75B that employ thousands of people.   \r\n\r\nHere is what some YC alums had to say about Leaders In Tech:\r\n\r\nJustin Kan (Twitch/YC):  \"It was a huge uplevel for me as a leader and a human being and I recommend it to all my founder friends.\"\r\n\r\nDaniel Kan (Cruise):  \"Best program I've ever done.  Highly recommend.\"\r\n\r\nHarj Taggar (YC):   \"This is the best thing a leader could do for their company\"\r\n\r\nJack Altman (Lattice):   \"I came in a skeptic and left a convert.\"\r\n\r\nClaire McDonnell (True Link):  I’m a better leader and human being (and also parent) because of it.\r\n\r\nAmir Nathoo (OutSchool):  I found LIT to be deeply transformative and hugely valuable for my company and life. Couldn’t recommend it more.\r\n\r\nJon Lerner (Cointracker):  LIT was the most impactful thing I’ve done for my growth as a person & leader. I highly recommend it to every YC founder.\r\n\r\nKanjun Qiu (Imbue):  LIT was life-changing for me and started my entire personal growth journey. I’m a much, much better founder (and much happier human) as a result.\r\n\r\nRead more private YC testimonials in the comments here:  https://bookface.ycombinator.com/posts/80276\r\n\r\nWe offer a dedicated 6-month program for Seed founders and a 10-month program for Series A to Pre-IPO.   Send me a DM if you would like a nomination.",
