        "bio": "Executive Chairman, Edge Aerospace (space computers for satellites and on-orbit data centers; in orbit, profitable). Founder of Magic (YC W15), CEO 2023-2026, grew ARR $3M to $40M, now Chairman. Founding CEO of Made In Space: first 3D printer on the ISS, first parts manufactured off Earth, became Redwire (NYSE: RDW). Chairman of Max Space. 12 US patents in in-space manufacturing.",
