    "name": "Dyspatch",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/14dfb847178b7f4bbd87cf5c343762a6ac57c19d.png",
    "oneLiner": "AI Email Production - Emails on brand, guaranteed to work, fast.",
    "longDescription": "Dyspatch is an AI-powered communications platform that transforms how teams build and manage transactional email at scale.\r\nOur platform uses AI to accelerate email creation — from generating and refining content to automating localization across 300+ locales — so your Product, Marketing, and CRM teams can ship polished, dynamic emails without touching code or waiting on developers.\r\nA centralized hub for creation, approval, and publishing, Dyspatch connects directly to your existing cloud email provider or messaging service. Upload your templates in minutes, and let AI handle the heavy lifting: optimizing copy, personalizing at scale, and streamlining the entire review-to-send workflow.\r\nBuilt for teams that move fast. No devs required.",
    "batch": "W14",
    "year": 2014,
