    "oneLiner": "AI Claims Investigator for Insurance",
    "longDescription": "Hesper AI builds AI agents that investigate P&C insurance claims end to end.\r\n\r\nHesper’s agents read the claim file, detect tampered documents, verify facts, check coverage, flag inconsistencies, and produce an audit-ready case file in minutes, so insurers can check every claim. \r\n\r\nWe work with Claims and SIU orgs at Carriers, MGAs and TPAs,",
