        "name": "Adam Rida",
        "title": "Founder/CEO",
        "bio": "I’m the founder of Tracer (S26), an AI research lab building more capable and efficient intelligence by coordinating open-source models.\n\nBefore Tracer, I built DeepRecall solo to €100k ARR in three months, scanning 100k+ marketplace products per day for product-safety risks.\n\nMy background is in applied machine learning and explainable AI. I was an AI PhD candidate at Sorbonne University, CNRS, and AXA, and previously worked at Société Générale, Rebellion Research, Qantev, and MFG Labs.",
