    "name": "Radley",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/eaa9729cc14d1a256b46037b05b50ac5b7f7c291.png",
    "oneLiner": "The AI-native radiology practice",
    "longDescription": "Radley is the first AI-native radiology practice. We're acquiring a radiology practice bringing Radley to $4.6M in annualized revenue and rebuilding it with agents from the ground up.\r\n\r\nRadiology is already in crisis: there aren't enough radiologists to interpret 1 in 6 medical scans. In 10 years, that gap is growing to 1 in 3 - 246M scans a year.\r\n\r\nFrom past experience, we know that point solutions won’t cut it. While there is demand (we have $2.2M in contracts to prove it), bottleneck isn't just software, it's outdated systems and slow, inefficient operations. That's why we own the full stack, clinical and operational, end to end.\r\n\r\nWe met at Carbon Health as we scaled operations 31x and expanded to 100+ clinics. Now we're rebuilding radiology.",
