    "name": "Waybill",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/b91adedb53afabc881281324143485f1dc3c6674.png",
    "oneLiner": "Agentic procurement & inventory for deep tech teams.",
    "longDescription": "Hardware teams burn weeks on procurement. An engineer needs a part. Someone emails five distributors, chases quotes, gets an approval, wires the money, tracks a shipment across three carriers, clears customs, and then nobody knows where the box is or what's actually on the shelf.\r\n\r\nWaybill runs that entire loop. Send us a part, a spec, or a BOM. We source it, pull quotes, route approvals, pay the supplier, handle freight and customs, track it to your dock, and keep your stock count updated. \r\n\r\nTake your supply chain for granted.\r\n\r\nBuilt by a team that's seen it at LAT Aerospace and WareIQ (YC S20).",
