    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/196624bfab919b6dd989cb601af1771954cb562e.png",
    "oneLiner": "Mass-producing and financing micro data center incredibly quickly.",
    "longDescription": "We mass-produce modular data centers that deploy on stalled infrastructure projects losing billions per week.\r\n\r\nDelayed infrastructure projects hemorrhage $1B a week in the US alone - Pacific mass-produces modular data centers that deploy on those sites in days and turn their unused power into revenue.\r\n\r\nData centers are stuck for years waiting for power, while delayed construction sites across the world sit on unused interconnects, losing billions of dollars per week in interest on trillions of dollars of debt. Our pods deploy on those sites and generate revenue for them in days. They use diamond wafers in the cooling system so pods run anywhere on earth, even a desert. \r\n\r\nWe'll use the same mechanisms we're building today to deploy compute across the galaxy.\r\n",
