        "name": "Alfredo Gonzalez",
        "title": "Founder/CEO",
        "bio": "Co-Founder and CEO of Omanta. PhD in Cancer Bioinformatics from UCLA, biomedical researcher at Broad Institute and Harvard.  Spearheaded personalized therapeutic campaigns for patients creating personalized vaccines, immunotherapies, and radioligands. 10+ years in personalized medicine. Fueled by the belief that the future of Health is deeply personalized.\n\n",
