    "name": "TareBio",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/9e770bbea41518001119968d389d0d3e35ce7abe.png",
    "oneLiner": "Vaccines for any cancer or infection in weeks.",
    "longDescription": "Our platform develops personalized or population-level vaccines for any disease in weeks by changing only one input: the immune imprint. Instead of trying to predict which antigens might work, we read out immune cells already fighting the disease in the body and reverse-engineer antigens that activate them. We've already run our platform end-to-end and created a vaccine that cured cancer in mice.",
    "batch": "S26",
