    "oneLiner": "AI brain for creators that runs their social content",
    "longDescription": "Grocalo (S26) is an AI brain that runs content for creators. We understand their audiences, using video understanding and deep platform analytics to bottle up the taste behind each creator and personalize and distribute content to creator specific audiences.\r\n\r\nGrocalo generated 2B views and gained 4M followers for our creators in the last 2 months. Some of our clients include Jimmy O. Yang (Comedian, 11M followers), King Bach (72M followers), Leenda Dong (28M followers), Steven He (30M followers), Sheena Melwani (18M followers), and Jeannie Mai (TV host, 6M followers).\r\n\r\nContent should be personalized and data-driven. We’ve developed the most advanced AI brain replicating viral content for any given audience. \r\n",
