    "longDescription": "Huscarl is building an autonomous AI actuary to enable self-insurance for corporations.\r\n\r\nLarge companies use insurance subsidiaries (\"captives\") to self-insure their risks. Some of these captives are larger than regional insurers. We provide them the actuarial and modeling layer to operate and grow.\r\n\r\nWe're building a future where self-insurance is the default, and commercial insurance the exception. This is the best way to solve the inefficiencies of the $1T corporate insurance market.",
