    "name": "Soria",
    "logo": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/05b2506991797891dcda24e0fe6be2c7f7a60423.png",
    "oneLiner": "AI Financial Research Terminal built for Healthcare (and beyond)",
    "longDescription": "Soria is an AI-native Financial Terminal for investors who specialize in a particular sector, starting with healthcare. Our agents convert hundreds of the most important public and private sources into an always-on financial model, reviewed by domain experts and delivered to hedge funds, banks, and asset managers through a terminal UI, MCP, API, warehouse sync, and research feed. Unlike our competitors, we own the data layer and expand bottom-up, one sector at a time - additionally our agents proactively do research on behalf of our clients without them lifting a finger or sharing any data.",
