    "oneLiner": "We get your product picked by coding agents.",
    "longDescription": "Coding agents like Claude Code, Codex and Cursor now decide which tools get installed in a codebase. Armature runs the real agents inside a panel of realistic repositories, measures whether they pick you, and works with your team on the docs, SDK and content that make them choose you.\r\n\r\nWe call this Agent-Led Growth (~coding agents GEO for dev tools).\r\n\r\nAnd once agents use your product, Armature shows you what users do with it through AI, with self-serve MCP analytics and evals that catch regressions before your users see them.",
